OL,3,GNEWSAPeople 'really worried' as town
OL,4,Aloses post office
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in a West Sussex town are
OL,7,F"really worried" their local post
OL,8,Foffice is closing, according to an MP.
OL,10,FHorley's central post office is due to
OL,11,Fshut on Saturday after the Morrison's
OL,12,Fsupermarket it was based in announced
OL,13,Fits closure.
OL,15,F"It's going to have a significant
OL,16,Fimpact on the town," said MP Chris
OL,17,FCoghlan. "It's just one more thing
OL,18,Fthat's closing."
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
