OL,3,GNEWSAPeople 'really worried' as town
OL,4,Aloses post office
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Post Office had tried to find a
OL,7,Freplacement retailer to host it, though
OL,8,Fit said those who expressed interest
OL,9,Fdid not have "suitable premises".
